! Image Preview Plugin

Adds click-to-enlarge preview functionality for images in TiddlyWiki using native JavaScript (no external dependencies).

!! Features

* Click any image to open a full-screen preview
* Zoom in/out and reset zoom functionality
* Navigation between multiple images on the same page
* Keyboard shortcuts (arrows, ESC, Ctrl+/-)
* Works with dynamically loaded images
* No external dependencies - pure JavaScript/CSS

!! Usage

After installing the plugin, all images will automatically have preview functionality.

Click on any image to open the preview modal. Use the control buttons or keyboard shortcuts to interact with the image.

