[img[https://imgbed.baiyapeng.cc/file/1766820604037_bingimg_20251221_UHD.jpg]]

!! Keyboard Shortcuts

|! Key |! Action |
| ESC | Close preview |
| ← → | Previous/next image |
| Ctrl + + / Ctrl + - | Zoom in/out |
| Ctrl + 0 | Reset zoom to 100% |
| Click outside image | Close preview |
| Mouse wheel | Zoom in/out |

!! Controls

* **×** (top right) - Close preview
* **❮** **❯** (left/right) - Navigate between images
* **−** **+** (bottom center) - Zoom out/in
* **↺** (bottom center) - Reset zoom

!! Customization

You can customize the plugin behavior by modifying the plugin's script.js file (CSS, scaling limits, etc.).

